  "description": "A comfortable and relaxing ride is what the LXI Flow 3 is all about. combining a Del Sol Comfort Springer saddle together with a suspension seat post, an SR suspension fork and an adjustable rise stem will guaranty this. And the lightweight aluminum frame, a Shimano Rapidfire Plus 1x9 drivetrain and hydraulic brakes will offer the rider light and efficient performance. Lastly and no less important, a uniquely proper fitting bicycle for most rider heights is achieved through frame sizing and proportionate wheel size. Depending on the frame size that best fits the customer, the bicycle is equipped with either a 26\", 27.5\" or a 29\" wheel size.\nLXI Flow lightweight aluminum frame with Size-Specific Wheel design and disc brake mount\nSR Suntour, 63mm Travel fork with Hydraulic Lockout\nForged Alloy crank arms, Bolt-On Alloy 38t chainwheel with dual alloy guard\nWide-range 1x9 drivetrain with Shimano Alivio Rapidfire Plus shifter\nAlloy adjustable rise-angle stem with 80mm rise alloy handlebar\nDel Sol Comfort Springer saddle with suspension seat post\nShimano CenterLock Disc hubs\nAlloy double wall rims with stainless steel spokes and Kenda Kwick Journey tires\nShimano MT201 Hydraulic Disc",
